msgid "ReliefNT 5.3.2"
msgstr "ReliefNT 5.3.2"

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid "新增原生 PCIe ``e1000e`` 网卡驱动，支持 Intel 82574L/82574IT 与 82583V，并由现有网络服务统一管理设备。"
msgstr ""
"Added a native PCIe ``e1000e`` network driver for Intel 82574L/82574IT and 82583V, with devices "
"managed by the existing network service."

msgid "新增可调度内核线程与工作队列，支持并行、合并及延迟工作；改进常驻管道 I/O 并行度和 FIFO 打开路由。"
msgstr ""
"Added schedulable kernel threads and workqueues supporting parallel, coalesced, and delayed work; "
"improved resident pipe I/O parallelism and FIFO open routing."

msgid "按 CPU 缓存物理地址位宽，减少重复读取和同步；写保护缺页在并发 COW 处理已完成时重新检查并继续，而不是误报故障。"
msgstr ""
"Cache physical address widths per CPU to reduce repeated reads and synchronization. Write-"
"protection faults recheck and continue when concurrent COW handling has already completed, rather "
"than falsely reporting a fault."

msgid "修复 netlink multipart dump 的完成报文边界，并使 ``ppoll`` 支持调用期间的临时 signal mask。"
msgstr ""
"Fixed completion-message boundaries for netlink multipart dumps and added temporary per-call "
"signal masks to ``ppoll``."

msgid "实现 ``RLIMIT_FSIZE`` 对文件写入的限制，并扩展 mount/bind 实例支持，为多个系统实例隔离挂载关系。"
msgstr ""
"Implemented ``RLIMIT_FSIZE`` limits on file writes and expanded mount/bind instance support to "
"isolate mount relationships for multiple system instances."

msgid "移除已退役产品激活身份辅助接口，并修正 GNU Unifont 构建下载来源。"
msgstr ""
"Removed retired product-activation identity helpers and corrected the GNU Unifont build download "
"source."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking Changes"

msgid ""
"**是，涉及内核内部 ABI、模块配套和一项已退役的私有接口。** 内核、initramfs、树外模块、符号版本及 ABI 清单必须使用同一版本；旧 ``.ko`` 和 prepared SDK "
"不能与本版混用。移除的产品激活身份 helper 不再提供，依赖它的程序须改用标准系统信息接口。没有改变既有 syscall 编号或磁盘文件系统格式。"
msgstr ""
"**Yes: internal kernel ABI, matching modules, and one retired private interface.** Kernel, "
"initramfs, out-of-tree modules, symbol versions, and ABI manifests must use the same version; old "
"``.ko`` files and prepared SDKs cannot be mixed with this release. Removed product-activation "
"identity helpers are no longer available; dependent programs must use standard system-information "
"interfaces. Existing syscall numbers and disk filesystem formats are unchanged."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Update and Migration Notes"

msgid ""
"本次为**源码 Release**，只提供标签和 GitHub 自动源码归档，不附预编译内核、模块、SDK 或镜像。使用 v5.3.2 对应配置执行 "
"``olddefconfig``，并重新构建完整内核与 initramfs；树外模块须使用本版 ``Module.symvers`` 和 prepared SDK。"
msgstr ""
"This **source Release** provides only a tag and GitHub automatic source archives, with no "
"precompiled kernel, modules, SDK, or images. Run ``olddefconfig`` with the v5.3.2 configuration "
"and rebuild the complete kernel and initramfs. Out-of-tree modules require this version's "
"``Module.symvers`` and prepared SDK."

msgid ""
"``e1000e`` 的设备表仅覆盖 Intel 82574L/82574IT 与 82583V。验证范围包括 QEMU 对 82574L 的模拟和 82583V host "
"model；不应据此推断其他同属 e1000e 家族的设备或实体网卡已验证。"
msgstr ""
"The ``e1000e`` device table covers only Intel 82574L/82574IT and 82583V. Validation covers QEMU's "
"82574L emulation and an 82583V host model; this does not establish validation of other "
"e1000e-family devices or physical network cards."

msgid ""
"新增 mount/bind 实例能力扩展挂载关系的隔离语义；更新时应使用匹配的用户态、内核和启动配置。``RLIMIT_FSIZE`` 对超出限制的写入返回文件大小错误，应用应检查短写及 "
"``EFBIG``。"
msgstr ""
"New mount/bind instance capabilities expand mount-relationship isolation semantics; update with "
"matching userspace, kernel, and boot configuration. ``RLIMIT_FSIZE`` returns file-size errors for "
"writes exceeding limits; applications must check short writes and ``EFBIG``."

msgid ""
"本版验证包含版本生成、字符串与数字宏、工具和 ownership 检查，以及 14 个 host smoke suites。该检查不等于完整系统启动、QEMU "
"全量回归或运行时驱动验收；VMware、实体硬件和长期稳定性尚未完成验收。"
msgstr ""
"Validation covers version generation, strings and numeric macros, tools, ownership checks, and 14 "
"host smoke suites. These checks are not full-system boot, complete QEMU regression, or runtime "
"driver acceptance. VMware, physical hardware, and long-term stability have not passed acceptance."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer Notes"

msgid ""
"``configs/build-version`` 为 **5.3.2**，生成的版本数字字段为 **5/3/2**；EXTRAVERSION、LOCALVERSION 和模块 ABI "
"后缀仍分别处理，并遵守完整 release 长度限制。"
msgstr ""
"``configs/build-version`` is **5.3.2**, generating numeric version fields **5/3/2**. EXTRAVERSION,"
" LOCALVERSION, and module ABI suffixes remain separately handled and obey full-release length "
"limits."

msgid "内核实现、UAPI、模块接口、探针和手册归属本仓；ReliefOS 桌面、打包、RPR 与镜像流程归主仓。保留既有 ABI golden，不以重生成基线掩盖差异。"
msgstr ""
"This repository owns kernel implementation, UAPI, module interfaces, probes, and manuals; the main"
" repository owns ReliefOS desktop, packaging, RPR, and image workflows. Retain existing ABI golden"
" data rather than regenerating baselines to hide differences."

msgid ""
"本次范围为 ReliefNT v5.3.1 提交 **d4e365ba2672c25cf33f8c3a7e3bcecfe62ee9c2** 之后至 v5.3.2 "
"标签指向的版本提交；仅汇总本仓最终生效内容，排除 ReliefOS 应用、打包及纯合并。下一版以该版本提交为起点。"
msgstr ""
"This range runs after ReliefNT v5.3.1 commit **d4e365ba2672c25cf33f8c3a7e3bcecfe62ee9c2** through "
"the version commit pointed to by v5.3.2. Summarize only final effective content here, excluding "
"ReliefOS applications, packaging, and pure merges. The next version starts at that version commit."
